@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8080
@token =

### 1) 管理员登录
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "admin123"
}

### 2) 志愿者注册
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "volunteer01",
  "password": "12345678",
  "displayName": "志愿者01"
}

### 3) 创建活动（将 {{token}} 替换为登录返回token）
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/activities
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "周末社区清洁",
  "description": "组织社区卫生清洁志愿行动",
  "location": "XX社区广场",
  "startTime": "2026-03-15T09:00:00",
  "endTime": "2026-03-15T12:00:00",
  "maxParticipants": 50,
  "status": "PUBLISHED"
}

### 4) 查询活动列表
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/activities
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
